0 41 652 [
[(The [line] object takes values for target/time/grain and ramps to the given)]
[(target over the specified time in milliseconds, updating its output at the)]
[("grain rate" \050also in milliseconds\051. A list up to 3 floats distributes the)]
[(values to the inlets, as usual in Pd. Note that the middle inlet \050that sets)]
[(the time\051 does not set values for the next ramp \050unlike every other inlet)]
[(in Pd\051 - thus, sending a float to the left inlet without priorly setting a)]
[(value in the middle inlet causes a jump in the output regardless of)]
[(whatever time value was specified in some previous message. On the other)]
[(hand, setting a grain value persists. A grain value of 0 or less becomes 20)]
[(\050the default value\051. If [line] gest a message specifying some new target)]
[(before reaching the previous one, it takes off from its current value.)]
] 14 -0 0 0 false DrawText
grestore
